@startuml EUDI_Issuance_Sequence
!define WALLET #B8D4E0
!define ISSUER #A8B8C0
!define IDP #FFE4B5

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2C5F77
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title OpenID4VCI Credential Issuance Flow

actor User as user
participant "EUDI Wallet" as wallet WALLET
participant "Issuer\n(Spanish Gov)" as issuer ISSUER
participant "Auth Provider\nCl@ve" as idp IDP

== Discovery Phase ==
user -> wallet : Scan QR offer
activate wallet
note right: **~50ms**\nParse URI
wallet -> issuer : GET /.well-known/openid-credential-issuer
issuer --> wallet : Metadata (algorithms, endpoints)
note right: **~200ms**\nNetwork + parse

== Authorization Phase ==
wallet -> wallet : Generate PKCE\ncode_verifier, code_challenge
note right: **~20ms**\nRandom generation
wallet -> idp : Authorize (code_challenge, redirect_uri)
idp -> user : Request authentication
user -> idp : Provide credentials
idp --> wallet : Authorization code
note right: **~2-5s**\nUser interaction

== Token Exchange ==
wallet -> issuer : POST /token\n(code, code_verifier)
issuer -> idp : Validate authorization code
idp --> issuer : OK
issuer --> wallet : access_token, c_nonce
note right: **~300ms**\nToken generation

== Proof of Possession ==
wallet -> wallet : generateKeyPair()
note right: **~100ms**\nES256 in Secure Enclave
wallet -> wallet : Create proof JWT\n(c_nonce, aud, key_id)
note right: **~50ms**\nSign with private key

== Credential Request ==
wallet -> issuer : POST /credential\n(access_token, proof_jwt, format: vc+sd-jwt)
issuer -> issuer : Verify proof JWT\nValidate nonce
issuer -> issuer : Issue SD-JWT\nwith disclosures
issuer --> wallet : credential (SD-JWT), c_nonce
note right: **~500ms**\nIssuance + signing

== Storage ==
wallet -> wallet : Validate SD-JWT signature
wallet -> wallet : Parse disclosures
wallet -> wallet : CredentialStore.store()
note right: **~100ms**\nSQLite insert + index
wallet --> user : Credential added ✓
deactivate wallet

note over wallet, issuer
  **Total time: ~3-6 seconds**
  (excluding user authentication)

  **Security checks at each step**
  - PKCE prevents authorization code interception
  - Proof JWT binds credential to wallet key
  - Signature verification before storage
end note

@enduml
